      },
      "lineNbr": 220,
      "author": {
        "id": 18914
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-06T02:04:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it makes sense to bundle them together into one flag at the `Caps` level for now with a comment that having them broken out may be useful in the future for the reasons you mentioned. \n\nAny backend-specific granular attributes could live within that backend `Caps` implementation (and potentially assigned based on the value of the high-level `Caps` flag if that\u0027s all that must be consulted), only being promoted to a high-level Caps flag if it helps inform higher-level decisions later on. \n\nWDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "25451227_5ef7f084",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 204,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 220,
        "endChar": 90
      },
      "revId": "e08cf1ab1de5b3e6985100eeeb3eef1283c5fee6",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
